# Key-only, one user. AcceptEnv mirrors the Debian/Ubuntu default, so the
# client's locale arrives the way it does on a typical bastion; clear it on the
# client side to see the ASCII fallback (terminal.rs, "aimed at SSH").
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin no
AllowUsers pane
AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
